<body>
<div class="app">
  <aside class="sidebar">
    <div class="brand"><div class="logo">◈</div><div><h1>Chinook PBIX<br>BI Studio Pro</h1><p>mau.pbix → OLAP → Dashboard</p></div></div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:8px"><span class="pill">PBIX extracted</span><span class="pill">Chinook model</span></div>
    <div class="section">Workspace</div>
    <div class="nav active" onclick="nav('overview')"><span class="ico">📊</span>Executive Overview</div>
    <div class="nav" onclick="nav('replica')"><span class="ico">🧩</span>PBIX Report Replica</div>
    <div class="nav" onclick="nav('model')"><span class="ico">🗂️</span>Data Model & OLAP</div>
    <div class="nav" onclick="nav('query')"><span class="ico">💻</span>SQL Studio</div>
    <div class="nav" onclick="nav('explorer')"><span class="ico">🔎</span>Data Explorer</div>
    <div class="nav" onclick="nav('insights')"><span class="ico">🤖</span>AI Insights</div>
    <div class="nav" onclick="nav('pbi')"><span class="ico">⚡</span>Power BI Pack</div>
    <div class="mini-card"><h3>PBIX source</h3><p id="pbixMini"></p></div>
    <div class="mini-card"><h3>Model status</h3><p>11 bảng Chinook, 5 visuals từ trang <b>Analysis</b>, report được dựng lại thành dashboard web nâng cao.</p></div>
  </aside>
  <main class="content">
    <div class="topbar">
      <div class="title"><h2 id="pageTitle">Executive Overview</h2><p id="pageSub">Tổng quan doanh thu Chinook từ report mau.pbix, có filter và drill-down.</p></div>
      <div class="toolbar">
        <select id="yearFilter" class="select" onchange="applyFilters()"></select>
        <select id="countryFilter" class="select" onchange="applyFilters()"></select>
        <select id="employeeFilter" class="select" onchange="applyFilters()"></select>
        <button class="btn secondary" onclick="resetFilters()">Reset</button>
        <button class="btn" onclick="exportCurrent()">Export CSV</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section id="panel-overview" class="panel active">
      <div class="grid4" id="kpiRow"></div>
      <div class="grid21">
        <div class="card"><div class="card-title"><h3>Revenue trend by year</h3><span>Invoice.Total</span></div><div class="chart-box"><canvas id="yearChart"></canvas></div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="card-title"><h3>Sales person share</h3><span>Top 3</span></div><div class="chart-box"><canvas id="employeeChart"></canvas></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid2">
        <div class="card"><div class="card-title"><h3>Top sales by country</h3><span>BillingCountry</span></div><div class="chart-box sm"><canvas id="countryChart"></canvas></div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="card-title"><h3>Revenue by genre</h3><span>Track → Genre</span></div><div class="chart-box sm"><canvas id="genreChart"></canvas></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid2">
        <div class="card"><div class="card-title"><h3>Top customers</h3><span>CustomerName</span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table id="topCustomerTable"></table></div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="card-title"><h3>Geographic concentration</h3><span>Top market ratio</span></div><div id="geoList" class="map-list"></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="panel-replica" class="panel">
      <div class="grid21">
        <div class="card"><div class="card-title"><h3>Rebuilt canvas from mau.pbix</h3><span>Original layout: 1280 × 720</span></div><div id="pbixCanvas" class="canvas-replica"></div></div>
